{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316910/extras/addtowishlist_gif.gif?t=1740175558\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316910/extras/about_.jpg?t=1740175558\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Uncursed</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game blending immersive storytelling, environmental exploration, and puzzle-solving. Navigate a house filled with unsettling secrets, uncover the dark past hidden beneath its walls, and escape before history repeats itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316910/extras/suni.gif?t=1740175558\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Alex</i></strong> thought he had left his past behind. But when his <i>grandmother</i> stops answering his calls, he returns home\u2014only to find a place warped by time, filled with eerie remnants of forgotten rituals and a creeping presence that watches from the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As he unravels the mystery surrounding his family, the walls begin to shift, shadows twist into something unnatural, and the truth he seeks may not be one he can survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316910/extras/LIGHTING.gif?t=1740175558\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With spine-tingling atmosphere, intense jump scares, and a haunting storyline, <strong>UNCURSED</strong> will keep you on the edge of your seat from start to finish. Can you survive the horrors that await you? <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316910/extras/room.gif?t=1740175558\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316910/extras/PUZZLESS_.png?t=1740175558\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The puzzles in UNCURSED are designed to be challenging but fair. They will require you to use your wits and logic to solve them. There is a variety of puzzles in the game, including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Logic puzzles:</strong> These puzzles will require you to use your reasoning skills to solve them. For example, you may need to figure out a code or solve a mathematical equation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316910/extras/CHESSI.gif?t=1740175558\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Inventory puzzles:</strong> These puzzles will require you to use items from your inventory in order to solve them. For example, you may need to combine two items to create a new item.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316910/extras/books_puzzle_gif.gif?t=1740175558\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Haunting Story \u2013 Unravel a mystery filled with loss, forgotten rituals, and the horrors of the past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An Ever-Changing House \u2013 The environment twists and distorts as Alex uncovers buried secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exploration &amp; Puzzle Solving \u2013 Search for clues, unlock hidden passages, and piece together the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unseen Forces \u2013 Feel the presence stalking you, hear whispers that were never meant for you, and question what is real.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316910/extras/end.png?t=1740175558\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Endings</strong> \u2013 Every choice matters. Will you break the <strong>curse</strong>, or will it <strong>consume you</strong>?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316910/extras/hell.gif?t=1740175558\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3316910?t=1740175558","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316910/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740175558","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316910/228a99fa8a6c772b29966d2388c17228cc5f7f1d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740175558","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316910/228a99fa8a6c772b29966d2388c17228cc5f7f1d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740175558","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3317010,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316910/extras/addtowishlist_gif.gif?t=1740175558\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316910/extras/about_.jpg?t=1740175558\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Uncursed</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game blending immersive storytelling, environmental exploration, and puzzle-solving. Navigate a house filled with unsettling secrets, uncover the dark past hidden beneath its walls, and escape before history repeats itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316910/extras/suni.gif?t=1740175558\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Alex</i></strong> thought he had left his past behind. But when his <i>grandmother</i> stops answering his calls, he returns home\u2014only to find a place warped by time, filled with eerie remnants of forgotten rituals and a creeping presence that watches from the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As he unravels the mystery surrounding his family, the walls begin to shift, shadows twist into something unnatural, and the truth he seeks may not be one he can survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316910/extras/LIGHTING.gif?t=1740175558\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With spine-tingling atmosphere, intense jump scares, and a haunting storyline, <strong>UNCURSED</strong> will keep you on the edge of your seat from start to finish. Can you survive the horrors that await you? <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316910/extras/room.gif?t=1740175558\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316910/extras/PUZZLESS_.png?t=1740175558\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The puzzles in UNCURSED are designed to be challenging but fair. They will require you to use your wits and logic to solve them. There is a variety of puzzles in the game, including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Logic puzzles:</strong> These puzzles will require you to use your reasoning skills to solve them. For example, you may need to figure out a code or solve a mathematical equation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316910/extras/CHESSI.gif?t=1740175558\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Inventory puzzles:</strong> These puzzles will require you to use items from your inventory in order to solve them. For example, you may need to combine two items to create a new item.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316910/extras/books_puzzle_gif.gif?t=1740175558\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Haunting Story \u2013 Unravel a mystery filled with loss, forgotten rituals, and the horrors of the past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An Ever-Changing House \u2013 The environment twists and distorts as Alex uncovers buried secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exploration &amp; Puzzle Solving \u2013 Search for clues, unlock hidden passages, and piece together the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unseen Forces \u2013 Feel the presence stalking you, hear whispers that were never meant for you, and question what is real.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316910/extras/end.png?t=1740175558\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Endings</strong> \u2013 Every choice matters. Will you break the <strong>curse</strong>, or will it <strong>consume you</strong>?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316910/extras/hell.gif?t=1740175558\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["AJB GAMES STUDIO"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316910/header.jpg?t=1740175558","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul clas